#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#Generic B-Class (Compact) hatchback with Strut front and Twist-beam rear suspension.
#
#Here, a twist beam is modeled as a variation on an independent suspension.
#
#This twist beam is of the type that uses a pair of trailing arms connected by a transverse beam. The transverse beam is located about mid-way between the forward bushings and wheel centers.
#
#See the Tech Memo "Example: An Alternative Twist Beam Suspension" for more information.
#
#This version is included in CarSim 2016 to show the use of new GUI screens for the parameters. VS Command equations are written automatically.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

